			"locked": false,
			"text": "Encrypted hash is decrypted with\nPuK3 giving us the Hash (H1)\nThe PuK2 of server is hashed\nagain by client using same method\ngiving another hash (H2)\n\nIf H1 == H2 then the public key\nof the server was not modified",
